        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur PARBIA, Clear Crystal Biarritz Knob with Parthenon Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Biarritz Knob with Parthenon Rose is so fancy that it will be at home in even the most ornate homes. The beautifully shaped crystal knob will catch the light and make is sparkle and the Parthenon Plate's details really helps to bring out the exquisite shape of the knob. Made by Grandeur, it has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-parthenon-series\"><b>Parthenon Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur PARBIA Parthenon Plate With Crystal Biarritz Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Parthenon Plate is made out of solid forged brass and the Biarritz Knob is 24% lead crystal.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Parthenon Plate With Biarritz Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 7.84\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Depth:  2.2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-PARBIA-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262319\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur PARBIA Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Biarritz Knob with Parthenon Rose, Grandeur PARBIA",
                "description": "Grandeur PARBIA, Biarritz Knob with Parthenon Rose - The Biarritz Knob with Parthenon Rose is so fancy that it will be at home in even the most ornate homes. The beautifully shaped crystal knob will catch the light and make is sparkle and the Parthenon Plate's details really helps to bring out the exquisite shape of the knob. Made by Grandeur, it has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
